Error [jet.BindingTypeMismatch]: Argument 2 to `.para_fold()` should be fn(fn(Int) -[]> Int Never!, Int) -> fn(Int) -[]> Int Never!, not fn(fn(Int) -> Int, Int) -[]> (fn(Int) -> Int) Never!
